   reply: {prompt: "Write your email to the caterer.", points: [["Peanut allergy stated", ["peanut", "allergy", "allergen"]], ["Confirmation in writing", ["writing", "written", "confirm"]], ["Cross-contamination (shared kitchen, cake)", ["cross", "shared kitchen", "cake", "nut-free", "peanut-free"]]]},
   why: "Check Leo's peanut allergy for every booking he attends. A shared kitchen is a cross-contamination risk, not just the dish.",
